{"id":1482,"title":"什么是列表推导？","summary":"什么是列表推导？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1fe44437-6031-354d-bc5d-19eb41ca6bb0","knowledge_id":164,"title":"什么是列表推导？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":164,"title":"什么是列表推导？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a80eca14-d19b-3ab5-b243-cb95bb8f68c4","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，列表推导是定义和创建列表的一种有效方法。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，列表推导是定义和创建列表的一种有效方法。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"524a5a47-410d-3763-9383-51cb5ec85358","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"word = 'PythonTip'\n\n# 创建单词中所有字母的列表\n# 使用列表推导\nletters = [letter for letter in word]\nprint(letters)\n\n# 输出: \n# ['P', 'y', 't', 'h', 'o', 'n', 'T', 'i', 'p']","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5712c34a-f586-39d2-a6b6-f549c8bf3602","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在示例中，可以使用`for`循环来完成同样的任务，如下所示：","text_html":"<p>在示例中，可以使用<code>for</code>循环来完成同样的任务，如下所示：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f0b51f4c-a828-35f5-bab6-c3a2537fa6b5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"word = 'PythonTip'\n\n# 创建单词中所有字母的列表\n# 使用for循环\nletters = []\nfor letter in word:\n    letters.append(letter)\nprint(letters)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f175b1b7-836a-3659-89c6-c65bea761ab7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"相比`for`循环的多行代码，列表推导只需一行就能完成，代码优雅简洁。\n\n此外，列表推导比`for`循环更快，因为`for`循环使用单独的`append()`函数将每个元素追加到列表中。而列表推导会一次性收集所有元素并将它们追加到一起。","text_html":"<p>相比<code>for</code>循环的多行代码，列表推导只需一行就能完成，代码优雅简洁。</p>\n<p>此外，列表推导比<code>for</code>循环更快，因为<code>for</code>循环使用单独的<code>append()</code>函数将每个元素追加到列表中。而列表推导会一次性收集所有元素并将它们追加到一起。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1482"}
